5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... hello everyone. I'm not really sure what to say first, but I hope we can all get along and find the werewolf together.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's keep this efficient. Since it's Day 0, we have no information yet, but I'll be watching everyone's reactions closely to see who slips up.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Watching reactions is all well and good, Shion, but let's not get too ahead of ourselves. I'm sure we'll all be on our best behavior for now.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shunichi. Let's try to keep things peaceful and supportive for now. It'll be much easier to trust each other if we start on a positive note.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,George,,I agree. Let us maintain our composure and observe the situation calmly. There is no need for haste on the first day.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree. I'll try my best to help, but I'm a bit nervous. Does anyone have a specific strategy they want to use?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Strategy is simple: we look for contradictions. If anyone claims a role or makes a definitive statement that doesn't hold up later, they're our primary target. For now, just speak naturally.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Naturally is the key, isn't it? Though I suspect some of us are far better at ""acting natural"" than others. I'm curious to see who tries too hard to fit in.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"That sounds a bit scary, Shunichi. I think we should focus on being honest with each other rather than suspecting everyone from the start.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,George,,"Honesty is a virtue, Midori, but in a game of deception, it is a luxury. We must balance trust with a healthy amount of skepticism.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I guess you're right, George. I'll try to be careful, but I'm not very good at this kind of thing. I hope I don't accidentally make anyone suspicious.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Don't be so timid, Daisuke. Your nervousness is actually quite predictable, which makes you less suspicious for now. I'm more interested in those who are too perfectly composed.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Now you're targeting me, Shion? I'll take that as a compliment. Being composed isn't a crime; it's just a sign of a stable mind.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,Let's not start arguing already. We should be focusing on how to support each other so we can find the werewolf without hurting any of our friends.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,George,,"Midori's kindness is appreciated, but we must remember that the werewolf is among us. Let us simply listen to one another for the remainder of the day.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll do that. I'll just listen and try to remember everything. Good luck to all of us tonight.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shion,,Good luck indeed. I'll be analyzing every word spoken today once the first result comes in tomorrow. See you all then.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll be doing the same. Let's see who among us has the strongest poker face when the sun rises. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Good night, everyone. I hope we all have peaceful dreams and wake up to some helpful clues tomorrow.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,George,,Good night. Let us hope for a productive morning and that the truth begins to reveal itself.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,,action,George,Shunichi,WEREWOLF,"{""action"":""divine"",""result"":""WEREWOLF"",""valid"":true,""raw"":""Shunichi""}"
