31,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Good morning... I'm glad we're all still here. Does anyone have any thoughts or... feelings about how we should start today?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Since we're all alive, the werewolf didn't attack yet, as per the rules. Now, the Seer should have information. George, you've been very quiet; do you have anything to share?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's not rush George. If he's the Seer, he might want to keep his information secret for a while to avoid becoming an immediate target. Right, George?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I think Shunichi is right. It's a very dangerous position to be in, so we should let George decide when he feels safe enough to speak.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,George,,"I appreciate your consideration, but I believe it is better to be direct. I am the Seer, and I have already found the werewolf. Shunichi is the werewolf.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,What?! Shunichi... is the werewolf? I... I can't believe it. I really trusted you...,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shion,,"That was fast. George, if you're telling the truth, this is the most efficient start possible. Shunichi, you've been very composed, but the Seer's word is definitive. What's your defense?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Now, this is a twist. George, I admire the boldness, but claiming the Seer role so early is a classic werewolf play to frame someone. I'm just a villager, I assure you.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Midori,,"This is so sudden... I don't want to believe it, but George seems so sure. Shunichi, is there any reason George would lie about this?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,George,,"None at all. I have no reason to lie, as my goal is to protect the village. I divined Shunichi last night, and the result was clear.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I want to believe George, but Shunichi sounds so sure of himself. It's so hard to tell who is lying... what should we do?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shion,,"The logic is simple. Either George is the Seer and Shunichi is the werewolf, or George is the werewolf lying to frame a villager. However, George's directness is more consistent with a Seer's goal.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, you're far too quick to trust a man just because he's ""direct."" If George is the werewolf, he's just eliminated me in one move. Isn't that the most logical play for a wolf?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I don't like this fighting... but if George is lying, then he's the one we should be worried about. George, are you absolutely certain? There's no mistake in your divination?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,George,,I am absolutely certain. The divination was unambiguous. I have no reason to risk my life by lying so blatantly if I were the werewolf; it would be an unnecessary gamble.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think I have to trust George. He's always been so calm and reliable... I'm sorry, Shunichi, but I think we should vote for you.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I agree. George's claim is too bold to be a bluff this early. If he were the wolf, he'd likely play a more subtle game to avoid immediate scrutiny. I'm voting for Shunichi.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"This is a tragedy of errors. You're all falling for a simple trick. If you execute me, you're just doing the werewolf's work for them. I'm a villager, and you're making a grave mistake.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I really don't want to do this, but George's conviction is hard to ignore. I'm sorry, Shunichi, but I think we have to follow the Seer's lead. I'll vote for you.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,George,,"It is a heavy burden to lead others to such a decision, but the truth must prevail for the safety of the village. I cast my vote for Shunichi.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
